{"title":"Duchess Flock Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003ePink and Blue Flocked Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"418\"\u003eMake a bold and unforgettable holiday statement with the Duchess Flock artificial Christmas tree collection from King of Christmas. Designed for those who love playful holiday décor with a luxurious twist, the Duchess Flock collection features vibrant pink and blue flocked artificial Christmas trees that instantly transform any space with color, texture, and personality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"418\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWith their richly flocked branches, full silhouettes, and warm white lighting, Duchess Flock trees offer a whimsical yet elevated alternative to traditional green Christmas trees. Whether styled with maximalist holiday décor or displayed as a standout centerpiece on their own, these colorful flocked trees bring a fun and fashion forward holiday aesthetic into your home season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2846\"\u003eAre Duchess Flock trees pre-lit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"3125\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eYes. Duchess Flock trees feature professionally installed warm white LED lights designed to create a soft and inviting glow throughout the tree. The warm lighting beautifully complements both the pink and blue trees flocked branches, adding warmth and contrast to the vibrant colors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3308\"\u003eAre colored artificial Christmas trees popular?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"374\"\u003eYes. Colored artificial Christmas trees have become increasingly popular for those looking to create a more personalized and expressive holiday aesthetic. Pink and blue Christmas trees offer a playful yet elevated alternative to \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/green-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Green Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003etraditional green trees\u003c\/a\u003e while still creating a warm, festive atmosphere throughout the home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"626\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eWith their vibrant flocking and glowing lights, Duchess Flock trees are especially popular for modern holiday décor, themed spaces, children’s bedrooms, playrooms, reading nooks, and secondary holiday displays that call for a fun and whimsical touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3874\"\u003eIs the Duchess Flock easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"4129\"\u003eYes. Duchess Flock trees are designed for easy setup and convenient after-season storage. Their hinged branch construction allows the branches to naturally fall into place during assembly, helping create a full and fluffy appearance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4312\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand, complimentary setup gloves for comfortable shaping and fluffing, and a complimentary storage bag for convenient off-season storage and protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4503\"\u003eWhen the season is over, the tree can be easily disassembled and stored in a cool, dry place to help preserve its flocking and overall appearance for years of continued holiday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4503\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the full Duchess Flock collection to find a colorful flocked artificial Christmas tree designed to bring playful luxury, glowing warmth, and unforgettable holiday beauty into your home season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-pink-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Pink Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Pink","offer_id":30106209878080,"sku":"PINKF-T6-5L","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Pink.Duchess.jpg?v=1718157841"},{"product_id":"7-5-pink-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Duchess Pink Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Pink","offer_id":30106209943616,"sku":"PINKF-T7-5L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Pink.Duchess_a8384dbd-fa30-4a3e-bf11-a02b344a79b9.jpg?v=1718158678"},{"product_id":"6-5-blue-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Blue Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Blue","offer_id":30106210041920,"sku":"BLUEF-T6-5L","price":359.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BlueDuchess_bf0a3bb7-e06d-4c25-9ab5-6f5eeed9128e.jpg?v=1714666421"},{"product_id":"7-5-blue-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Duchess Blue Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Blue","offer_id":30106210140224,"sku":"BLUEF-T7-5L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BlueDuchess_69c41b62-c1c6-436a-99c8-78b2c505eb2a.jpg?v=1714666419"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Queen_Flock_ec209c65-3187-4bbb-a189-11fa815860d4.jpg?v=1722012181","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/duchess-flock-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}